Package: org.legacyshazam.smoke
Name: ShazamX
Version: 0.3.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Song recognition for Shazam 5.5.1 on iOS 6 and Shazam 7.2.0 on iOS 7.
 .
 Netrun is the default recognition server. Render remains available in Settings.
 .
 Known limitation: opening a saved tag can remain on the loading screen on Shazam 7.2.0.
 .
 Enable or disable ShazamX in Settings > ShazamX.
Maintainer: mrnik12
Author: mrnik12
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
